{"server":"cn","storyId":"act35side_level_act35side_st03","groupId":"act35side","stageId":"act35side_st03","title":"十字路口，再出发","storyCode":"AS-ST-3","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act35side/level_act35side_st03.txt","sourceHash":"6c8a431544f8aa6e097c2c68a6c93bb5283ccd30431ebb2d7c6e448626f241c8","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g10_grandbazaar_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珠光宝气的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_804_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，真可惜，我的庭院只被毁了一半。我想借此机会给庭院换个风貌，结果剩下的雕塑和绿植反而不便处理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珠光宝气的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_804_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过修复工作倒是差不多完成了，也许休息日你有兴趣来坐坐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣着考究的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1494_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多谢好意，恐怕我抽不开身。我的宝石收藏都混到了一起，为了恢复那间几百年的收藏室，我得先逐一鉴定石头的功效。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以，博物馆损坏的事情......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我绝对会瞒过去的！要是瞒不过去，我就对父亲晓之以理，动之以情......总之，他会帮忙说服所有投资者的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有博物馆那批特殊的新藏品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，这个我也会在信里帮你们说清楚的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，我不觉得父亲会同意你们对任何人展出宝石构装体复建的古建筑局部哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我理解，比起展示，博物馆更重要的工作是保存历史......也包括保持历史的背面不被人看见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你，佩佩，我今晚可以睡个好觉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不对不对，不是该我对你们道谢吗？感谢你和缇缇帮我寻找宝石，完成了这次历史大发现，以及......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......娜仁图亚小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？没事没事，就是听你们讲了半天博物馆的事有点无聊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我把您请过来，原本是想和佩佩一起，向您表达感谢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"娜仁图亚女士，您说希望把“优待阿雅吉和阿雅妮”写进馆规，我们正在......以一种比较隐晦的方式兑现。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是哪个时代的陶俑吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，是博物馆两名正式入职的新人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算天气热得路都熔化了，也会按时去上班的两个傻子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在卸下代理馆长的职责，离开博物馆之前，我会交代大家特别关照她们的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我还是很难相信，阿娜特。你真的要放弃现在的职位吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，父亲不会喜欢我这个决定的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，我从记事起就一直透过窗户看着这座城市，现在我觉得，或许我已经把它读完了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它的历史，它的前身。它深埋地下的、若没有你这样横冲直撞的探险者就不会被发掘的秘密。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......真奇妙，只过了两天，城市就恢复运转了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"虽然那么多房子不知道要修补到什么时候，出现裂痕的路也要重新铺......但是水道已经完全清澈了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那当然啦。河水是一直在流淌的嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是呀，河水永远向前流淌，无论多少座城市变成沙子，沙子上再建起多少座城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......让流水带走一切，或许算不上一种选择，只是在永恒面前必然的结果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但永恒本无意义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉，就像缇缇说的那样，博物馆偶尔办一些出格的展览，其实也不坏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼，这个我也觉得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"说起来，我来到这里之前，还真的幻想过一场惊心动魄的冒险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不过，我想的可不是现在这种，而是有人盯上了我的宝石，我跟他斗智斗勇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉，实际上根本没人跟我作对，想想还有点可惜呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......哈哈。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g17_deserttown_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，佩佩，我还有一个问题想向你请教。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道的，我一直都很崇拜埃里克森先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然我之前研究祖拜尔的论文已经全数作废......我希望像埃里克森先生一样，去看看大地上其他的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后，像他一样将自己的见闻整理成信......再寄给他！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总之，我一定要和他成为笔友！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，这倒是很充分的离开博物馆的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是你站在城市街心花园里都能中暑，要去野外考察，至少也该先找个力士训练体能吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我才要向你学习经验，佩佩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我可以乘着有冷气的长途车走遍大地吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g6_museum_core"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿雅吉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起，娜仁图亚，我们也想送得更远一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿雅吉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是为了全勤奖，我们必须在博物馆努力工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿雅吉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且这个摄像机真的很好玩——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿雅妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1485_1","isRemote":false,"text":"闭嘴，这是要送给娜仁图亚的录像带，她会一直带在身边的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿雅妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1485_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，娜仁图亚，特别特别想你的时候，我们会往河里丢金币的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿雅妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1485_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听说城里那条河会一直流到大地的尽头，所以你无论去了哪里，一定能捡到我们留下的金币。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿雅吉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对，阿雅妮说得对。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g1_menatmainstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齐娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要指出一个地理学上的事实，实际上这条河甚至不会流到米诺斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有些事情你可以不说出口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再说，我也不打算走到大地尽头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齐娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......为什么突然决定丢下她们，一个人去走“天途”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可没丢下她们，只是那两个最傻的小孩也终于找到去处了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天途的规矩，以前我是一条都做不到，现在我至少可以一个人到处走走，顺带给这段旅途起个名字叫天途。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是很省事吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齐娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齐娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾几次在心里猜测你是不是梦魇，但我以为你避讳自己这一身份。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？只是没什么好说的，所以没说。要是我娜仁图亚的名字不能比梦魇这个身份更响亮，那多丢人啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齐娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那你天途的终点在哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按道理来说，天途最后应该走回自己家，但我很早以前犯了一些事，所以回不去了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齐娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"家？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，虽然大家一般把自己选择的试炼之地称作终点，但天途得到了试炼之地再活着回家，才算结束。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，那才是最难的。很多人都会越走越远。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不喜欢为难自己，不如......等我收到下一个手下，就算天途结束吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齐娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......祝愿你路途顺利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢？这几天在博物馆里参观够了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齐娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梅捷缇克缇女士的慷慨使我得以浏览诸多非公开藏品，但所见越多，我越能察觉我知识的空缺，乃至米诺斯历史的空白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齐娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在帮助她们写完改建米诺斯展厅的文书之后，我在这里已经没有更多能做的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齐娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会带着这些馆藏的照片回米诺斯，将资料提交给专家，希望他们证明米诺斯曾有哲学辩论这一竞技项目。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齐娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......然后，或许我会带着金杯回家看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，说到这个，我还有件礼物要给你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"长途车队快出发了，你赶快拿着它逃......不是，拿着它回米诺斯吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再会了，朋友。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"背过夕阳，娜仁图亚潇洒地转过身，迈开步子。\n不出所料，片刻之后，身后传来了阿斯帕齐娅惊讶的声音。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齐娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这是存放在博物馆里的那只金——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你只要说声谢谢，然后带着赃物火速离开就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别多问。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齐娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......谢谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......哈，你竟然真的不问？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齐娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有些事情我可以不说出口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齐娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"衷心感谢你，娜仁图亚，这趟旅途我收获颇丰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好啊。"},{"type":"narration","text":"车队将要出发的摇铃声响起，娜仁图亚头也不回地摆了摆手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有我给的金子作为祝福，你最好能拿到一块金牌。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"说到收获......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我忙碌了一个月，搞到手的唯一一件宝物就是那只金杯......好像还有什么来着，算了，想不起来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......没关系，这都是我自己选的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"金子打的一个杯子嘛，以后一定还会有的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g12_gemexchange"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉恕尔呀，你都要走了，真的不能让我表演一次吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我保证会把你的发条小玩具一口吞掉，再完整地吐出来，不留任何牙印。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果你真的想，我又能拿你有什么办法呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吞吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也想知道，它还能不能脱胎换骨，长出真正的羽毛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它只是舍不得你，拉恕尔。你不用被它拖延脚步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宝石交易所立下的规则已经深入人心，没有你，大巴扎也会推选出新的监管人，或者制定另一种秩序。你尽可以放心地离开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你们的存在近乎永恒，真的还会感到不舍吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，这可是辉煌之城的宝石交易所，我从来都是挑最好的住处！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以试试去养一只真正的宠物。不是我与米奥这样的兽主，也不是发条羽兽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"据我观察，成功的商人都会饲养很特别的宠物，所以你至少要以白化羽兽或者三米长的彩色鳞为标准，明白吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来吧，摸摸头。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"米奥看似并不情愿地跳到人类面前的方桌上，低下头，盘起尾巴。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（呼噜声）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g16_desertoasis"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g13_invertedpyramid"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再见，小人类。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g12_gemexchange"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再见。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g12_gemexchange"},{"type":"narration","text":"许久之后，它睁开眼睛。无人注目的房间里，它身后的影子变得庞大，远超一只云兽的体型。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那么，你还要留在这里吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祖拜尔已经安息并离开，沙阿的后人取得了宝库的真相，那些在漫长时光中回响的呓语......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，你也把梦魇带去看那些金银珠宝了，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她跳进地下水道深处，已经证明了自己的勇气，所以，我履行了对祖拜尔的承诺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"承诺......祖拜尔离开之后，我们的承诺也算是全部完成了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在的，千年之前的，都完成了。这座城市已经和我们最初的承诺没有任何关系了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我还是会留下来，因为现在这座城市活着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我承诺守护死者，是为了他们的苏生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还以为你会怀念黄金之城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如今那座沉默的黄金之城吗？它已经不需要我们了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，是啊，一整座城市都像被万王之王割掉了舌头，我不喜欢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我和你的想法不一样。我偏要去看看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g6_museum_core"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，把需要拜访的投资者名单给我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这边的藏品你们清点一下，后续我来安排修复工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......等等，这个不是琥珀，不要送到自然类展区。你没看到里面是一块宝石构装体的残片吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个你就当是我的私人藏品，先放在一边......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——好眼熟的云兽，是拉恕尔家的那只吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来，让我摸摸你的毛，看看你这次嘴里会吐出来什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，嗯，对，这正是我想要的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，是我在说话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在你已经被我指定为饲养员，明白了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之后要去哪里，你就得听我的了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g8_sargondeluxeroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"佩佩，有人找你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"稍等......我还有一句结语就要完成了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和你关于祖拜尔的论文吸引了不少学界人士与媒体，这几天要前来拜访你的人络绎不绝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你觉得困扰，我可以为你回绝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，没关系，我都可以见见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望这篇论文能吸引到更多的人，这些关于祖拜尔的文字，我希望能受到全萨尔贡的关注。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那好，我带她进来了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，您的步态很是轻盈，一路走来，我只听到您身上的配饰响动，却丝毫听不到您的脚步声。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦......辉煌的史官家族......不被选择的继承者......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我忘了介绍一下自己。我是万王之王的使者......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"来自黄金之城的使者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想为陛下向您转达感激与赞赏，感激您为萨尔贡历史所添下的精彩一笔，还有，我要给您一道陛下亲授的旨意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"来自黄金之城的使者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈特谢普苏特，陛下希望您亲临黄金之城，为他讲述您在米纳特哈玛仪的经历。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"来自黄金之城的使者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烦请开始为动身做准备吧，陛下正期待着您的到来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
